		{"id":"candidates","type":"text","text":"2. ActionSet 给出 ActionTag 候选及权重；按距离、角度、可激活性过滤。","x":480,"y":260,"width":420,"height":190,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"random","type":"text","text":"3. BossAIController 的确定性随机流抽取候选，记录选择。","x":980,"y":260,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"request","type":"text","text":"4. 激活任务用 ActionTag 找对应 GA，向 BossState ASC 申请激活。","x":1480,"y":260,"width":420,"height":185,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"execute","type":"text","text":"5A. 成功：GA 驱动 Montage / Trace / GE；任务等能力结束。","x":1480,"y":610,"width":420,"height":180,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"fail","type":"text","text":"5B. 拒绝或无候选：BT 走失败/其他动作，不在任务里直接造成伤害。","x":980,"y":610,"width":420,"height":185,"color":"3"}
